  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-28T00:19:23.037Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There's a small selection of public Fallback/Quest avatars available on the Avatars menu, and it's not enough choices for those who aren't avatar creators.\nCommunity Labs seems to be a great way to encourage world creators to improve the quality-of-life of worlds before they are published.\nI'd like for VRChat to encourage avatar creators who create public Quest-compatible avatars to be given the option to enroll their selected creations in a \"Avatar Labs\" process which will eventually have their optimized avatar rolled out to the Public list for all to use.",
